    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d487">

                <pb facs="1041" n="1007" xml:id="pg1007"/>

                <head>487. Telegram From the Department of State to the Embassy in Laos<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d487-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1957-10-25T18:38:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 25,
                                1957—6:38 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>434. Vientiane 660 repeated Paris 127 London 121 Saigon 172 Bangkok Phnom Penh
                        Unnumbered;<anchor n="2" xml:id="d487-f2"/> Vientiane 661 repeated Paris 126
                    London 120 Saigon 171 Bangkok Phnom Penh Unnumbered.<anchor n="3"
                        xml:id="d487-f3"/> Vientiane 659<anchor n="4" xml:id="d487-f4"/> not
                    received but we assume it contains information re new text political agreement
                    which would be even greater surrender to PL than that reported Vientiane
                        646.<anchor n="5" xml:id="d487-f5"/> We sincerely hope this may be exploited
                    Western advantage as was PL demand RLG accept Chinese Communist aid.</p>
                <p>We are opposed terms all known agreements and you may interpret instructions and
                    specific criticisms set forth Deparment’s 403, 414, and 422 as strongly as
                    circumstances warrant.</p>
                <p>We continue endorse (Department’s 1567 to Vientiane June 18, 1957<anchor n="6"
                        xml:id="d487-f6"/>) your use four-step policy set forth paragraph 4
                    Vientiane 2077.<anchor n="7" xml:id="d487-f7"/></p>
                <p>Message from Secretary to Crown Prince<anchor n="8" xml:id="d487-f8"/> being
                    revised conform new situation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">Dulles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
